**Read:** [Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy — Ray and Pugazhenthy, NPTEL](../sources/Nonferrous-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_29G1ZF58Y8EG123MNX3ZRNRE2W), all complete relevant family/theory sections; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), whole applicable metal-family and shared-process chapters; [Rare Earth Elements: Production, Processing, Recycling, and Environmental Issues — U.S. EPA](../sources/Rare-Earth-Production-Processing-and-Recycling-EPA.lingua#r_1GYVPYR8E6Q2CGEDBXQYDJYP9Q), the entire report and full original methods for a rare-earth case; [Extractive Metallurgy of Rare Earths — Krishnamurthy and Gupta, second edition](../sources/Extractive-Metallurgy-of-Rare-Earths.lingua#r_7N9A21D2P7EZ2TBXA81JMHZ06N), the complete monograph for further authorized specialization, when available; [Extração de Ouro: Princípios, Tecnologia e Meio Ambiente — CETEM](../sources/Extracao-de-Ouro-CETEM.lingua#r_5TP6BXRQ7NWKZQZ94WCBQRR8PN), the entire book for a gold/related recovery case; [Metais Não Ferrosos e suas Ligas — Cassio Barbosa](../sources/Metais-Nao-Ferrosos-e-Suas-Ligas-Barbosa.lingua#r_0FJ1378X0JMVHYVBFAXGK2399D), whole applicable metal-family chapters, when available.

Choose a technically consequential family beyond iron, aluminium, and copper: nickel/cobalt, zinc/lead/tin, titanium/magnesium, a refractory/minor metal, a rare-earth separation/product, or a precious-metal system. Complete its full course/technical chapters and primary methods; read the whole public rare-earth report or CETEM gold book where relevant. The complete rare-earth monograph and Portuguese alloy book support further authorized specialization.

Define the actual feed association and chemical/physical separation problem, product form/specification, purity/impurities, supporting utilities/equipment, and residuals. Identify what is unique to this family and reuse the generic thermodynamic, kinetic, phase, transport, balance, analytical, and manufacturing knowledge without copying it into an unrelated new theory.

Reproduce a substantial published result and independently verify multi-element quantities, phase/speciation or separation, energy/charge where relevant, and uncertainty. Compare a substantive alternative feed or process route and validate the consequential claim using independent observations or clearly scoped supplied data.

**Work:** produce a deep technical/research-style study connecting a whole extraction/refining chain with qualified material preparation, inspection/use, and recovery. Compare competing mechanisms and explain a significant discrepancy, inaccessible process detail, or unresolved question. Defend the experiment or authorized knowledge transfer that would most change the conclusion. The result should demonstrate genuine deepening in the selected material system while retaining its connections to the shared body of knowledge.

**Continue:** [Defend an alloy transformation and property mechanism with primary theory and independent observations](Advanced-transformation-structure-and-performance-study.lingua#r_50KR94MJEMFJNDKBE3J0F3J3T4).

**Return:** [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1).
